#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:3
#: 93f62a3eebd14056b20a0e7f41d86051
msgid "晶格应变（Lattice Strain）"
msgstr "Lattice Strain"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:5
#: 9fe1fddb65a04c3096e9f8890eaed69c
msgid "`Group`: `Lattice` | `Class`: `CellStrainCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:7
#: d48cf04e6c8948a4bc3941be3e7e8d4e
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:9
#: 8ed099a983a44885af9897ce66eeefb9
msgid "对晶胞轴向做受控应变扫描。选定方向组合（单轴/双轴/三轴/各向同性），给定拉伸百分比和步长，程序按比例缩放晶格矢量，生成一组不同应变的结构。"
msgstr ""
"Scan controlled axial strains of the cell. Choose a uniaxial, biaxial, "
"triaxial, or isotropic mode and provide percentage ranges and steps; the "
"card scales lattice vectors to generate the requested strain states."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:11
#: fc64d1f3ca9d4660babf99c02c6ac97a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\epsilon_i=\\frac{s_i}{100},\\quad "
"\\mathbf{C}'=\\mathbf{D}\\mathbf{C},\\quad "
"\\mathbf{D}=\\mathrm{diag}(1+\\epsilon_x,1+\\epsilon_y,1+\\epsilon_z)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:13
#: 808bd97054bb458cb0c0d0316f829c4d
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:15
#: 83572484b6744b93850cb29e94dc04ea
msgid "场景：模型预测的弹性常数偏差太大"
msgstr "Scenario: Predicted elastic constants have a large bias"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:17
#: cd5a16ec7ed042f48dbe5ab5229d045f
msgid ""
"你在 Si 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，能量-体积曲线拟合得很好，但算出来的 C11 比 DFT 参考值高了 "
"15%。这说明训练集里所有结构都处在平衡体积附近，模型没见过晶格被拉伸/压缩的构型，只能外推——外推不准。"
msgstr ""
"A Si NEP reproduces the energy-volume curve but predicts C11 15% above the "
"DFT reference. The training set is concentrated near equilibrium and does "
"not show the model explicit tensile and compressive states, so the elastic "
"derivative relies on extrapolation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:19
#: 38a39f80551c41afaf998cec2b1b1f4c
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** "
"弹性常数是能量对应变的二阶导数。如果训练集在平衡点附近的应变成分太稀疏，导数拟合就不可靠。解决办法是往训练集里加入一组已知应变的晶格，让模型\"见过\"被拉伸和压缩的晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Elastic constants are second derivatives of energy with "
"respect to strain. Sparse strain sampling around equilibrium makes these "
"derivatives unreliable. Add cells with known tensile and compressive strains"
" so the model interpolates locally."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:21
#: a9b5935855434cf19422a0162ab3138e
msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 Si 单胞（当前训练集里唯一的结构）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A relaxed Si unit cell, currently the only structure in the "
"training set."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:23
#: 58c829fb59654480a5966e326074c0ca
msgid "**目标：** 沿 x 方向做 -2% 到 +2% 的单轴应变，步长 1%，共 5 个结构，让模型在 ±2% 范围内有内插依据"
msgstr ""
"**Objective:** Apply uniaxial x strains from -2% to +2% in 1% steps, "
"producing five structures for interpolation within that range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:25
#: 86667ef9f4fb4b90bd2e24746f6e6e67
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:26
#: dcb1cbe07844422780f42ead25033ce6
msgid "`Axes` = `uniaxial`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:27
#: 1802ae7869aa422c81215b5f491e81f0
msgid "`x_range` = `[-2, 2, 1]` （-2% 到 +2%，每 1% 一步）"
msgstr "`x_range` = `[-2, 2, 1]` (-2% to +2% in 1% steps)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:29
#: 5cbaf2c371f7468c89ce18de73e5afd0
msgid "**输出：** 5 个结构（-2%, -1%, 0%, +1%, +2%），晶格 x 分量逐步拉长，原子分数坐标保持不变"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Five structures (-2%, -1%, 0%, +1%, +2%) with progressively "
"scaled x lattice vectors and fixed fractional coordinates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:31
#: 78a1459817ae4bc0adc6a2ab7f547895
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:32
#: de0e99e975f941aea2bbdd6c2878db3c
msgid "重训后重新计算 C11，应该比之前更接近 DFT 参考值"
msgstr "Retrain and recompute C11; it should move closer to the DFT reference."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:33
#: 139c7c26f2cf489ea68940f1085b007c
msgid "如果改善不够，把范围扩大到 ±5%，加 biaxial 方向，增加采样密度"
msgstr ""
"If improvement is insufficient, extend the range toward ±5%, add biaxial "
"states, or increase sampling density."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:34
#: aff17b601b904f24bdeef7c57547af55
msgid "如果应变 +5% 后最近邻键长超过物理合理区间（和 DFT 参考键长差 > 0.2Å），说明到了非物理变形区，上限回调"
msgstr ""
"If +5% strain moves the nearest-neighbor distance more than 0.2 Å beyond the"
" DFT reference, treat the deformation as suspect and reduce the upper bound."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:36
#: d21c7b98b6284492b343ff062735d409
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:38
#: 5bd7b9f7a8d44851b49b1cab45fe2ff0
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:39
#: 59bc87c6b06c4fb7bc4bde9636eb6f4c
msgid "模型弹性常数、体模量、应力-应变响应系统性偏差大"
msgstr ""
"Elastic constants, bulk modulus, or stress-strain response show systematic "
"bias"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:40
#: 48d7fabff9df48d7b7389692beffc792
msgid "训练集中所有结构体积/形状过于集中在平衡态附近"
msgstr ""
"Training-set cell volumes and shapes are concentrated too tightly around "
"equilibrium"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:41
#: b18def5faaca4f6fa8d3b06d314f7a09
msgid "需要模型在变形路径上有内插能力而非外推"
msgstr "The model should interpolate rather than extrapolate along a deformation path"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:43
#: 8eae131a45b04239be80de8953881944
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:44
#: 2fe0c15efeae4f2e8f1540fdd3e0c966
msgid "只需要局部原子坐标噪声（用 `Atomic Perturb` 更合适）"
msgstr "Only local coordinate noise is needed; use `Atomic Perturb` instead"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:45
#: 3fe6e4db1db54505bd001d8cf0108e5f
msgid "体系本身对应变不敏感（如刚性分子晶体），加了只是增大训练集体积没帮助"
msgstr ""
"The target system is insensitive to this strain and the added structures "
"would only inflate the dataset"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:47
#: 334508523bb947f5b41aa57144f28d22
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:48
#: 8154c5900285436797eda607c8b25132
msgid "Axes（axes）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:50
#: f01a174320054070845fdde94bd9e334
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'uniaxial'`。选 `uniaxial` 就只沿一个方向拉/压，补 C11/C22/C33 "
"这类单轴弹性响应；`biaxial` 同时动两个方向，面内耦合和泊松效应都能覆盖；`isotropic` 三个方向等比例缩放，更接近 EOS "
"和体模量采样。注意，别在只想做体积曲线的时候打开三轴独立扫描（`triaxial`）——那会触发热爆炸级的组合数。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `'uniaxial'`. `uniaxial` strains one direction for responses "
"such as C11/C22/C33; `biaxial` strains two directions to sample in-plane "
"coupling and Poisson response; `isotropic` scales all axes equally for EOS "
"or bulk-modulus sampling. Do not choose independent `triaxial` scans for a "
"simple volume curve: the Cartesian product can become enormous."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:52
#: 0cff6685b864463d80473633b409a99a
msgid "X Range（x_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:54
#: f8610023f96b4987a326909858ed4bc9
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`。格式是 `[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`，单位 "
"%。只有 `Axes` 激活的方向才生效；isotropic 模式只认 x_range。步长越小、范围越宽，输出的结构就越多。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`. A `[minimum, "
"maximum, step]` range in percent. It applies only to directions enabled "
"under `Axes`; isotropic mode uses only `x_range`. Smaller steps and wider "
"ranges produce more structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:56
#: aea0c302ea374f17a7b309c4217f27f5
msgid ""
"典型参考值：±1~2% 是大多数无机晶体的弹性区，键长变化一般不到 0.1 Å，补弹性常数首选这个区间。推到 ±3~5% "
"就进入非谐区了，适合做应力-应变曲线覆盖，抽检输出确认没有非物理键长。如果你设到 ±6% "
"以上，那是极端变形，很可能拉断键——每批跑完务必抽查最近邻距离。"
msgstr ""
"As a starting point, ±1-2% is the elastic regime for many inorganic crystals"
" and usually changes bond lengths by less than 0.1 Å. ±3-5% enters a more "
"anharmonic regime suitable for stress-strain coverage. Above ±6% is extreme;"
" inspect nearest-neighbor distances in every batch."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:58
#: 61ca1ff8711c4c2dba2d52f9958f9afc
msgid "Y Range（y_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:60
#: 07dea365c692430dba2339fd6a6c49df
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`。语法和 x_range 完全一样，仅作用在 y "
"轴。只有 `Axes` 激活的方向才生效。isotropic 模式不单独看 y_range。典型参考值和 x_range 一致：±1~2% "
"弹性区，±3~5% 非谐区，±6%+ 需要警惕非物理键长。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`. Same syntax and "
"guidance as `x_range`, applied to y when that axis is enabled. Isotropic "
"mode does not use it separately."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:62
#: e6d5d49989fe400298599c6ebd7ccc49
msgid "Z Range（z_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:64
#: 0fd02112e205400d91dd2d14aacd5487
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`。同上，只作用于 z 轴。isotropic "
"模式不单独看 z_range。典型参考值同上：±1~2% 弹性区，±3~5% 非谐区，±6%+ 注意抽查最近邻距离。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`. Same syntax and "
"guidance as `x_range`, applied to z. Isotropic mode does not use it "
"separately."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:66
#: 2275aea955b140848f039187563589c5
msgid "Identify Organic（identify_organic）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:68
#: f89091dac67741599b869662b43de9a9
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 "
"`false`。分子晶体、MOF、有机半导体这几种场景必须打开——打开后程序会识别有机分子团簇，晶格应变只作用在分子间，分子内部的键长尽量保持刚性。纯无机晶体关着就行，开了反而多算一堆团簇检测。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Enable for molecular crystals, MOFs, and organic "
"semiconductors. The card identifies molecular clusters and keeps "
"intramolecular bonds approximately rigid while straining intermolecular "
"geometry. Leave it disabled for purely inorganic crystals."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:70
#: dc94f46475a6448091c9d5e935d73624
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:72
#: f65d4490fc0842388e43239356d7a401
msgid "近平衡弹性（isotropic ±1%，适合补体模量）"
msgstr "Near-equilibrium elasticity (isotropic ±1%, suitable for bulk modulus)"

