"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CellStrainCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"organic\": false,\n"
"  \"engine_type\": \"biaxial\",\n"
"  \"x_range\": [-6, 6, 2],\n"
"  \"y_range\": [-6, 6, 2],\n"
"  \"z_range\": [-6, 6, 2]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:111
#: d5e33fbeafe749699db60d2e9680663f
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:113
#: c53d53d8bac34843b1c068cf09c04796
msgid "`Lattice Strain` → `Atomic Perturb`：应变 + 坐标噪声，同时覆盖几何变形和热扰动"
msgstr ""
"`Lattice Strain` -> `Atomic Perturb`: combine cell deformation with "
"coordinate noise"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:114
#: d23c6650f752423b9a1d000ed7fc01e6
msgid "`Lattice Strain` → `Shear Matrix Strain`：先补轴向应变，再补剪切分量"
msgstr ""
"`Lattice Strain` -> `Shear Matrix Strain`: sample axial strains before shear"
" components"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:115
#: 3f0601efe490486cabb3466579f4423c
msgid "`Super Cell` → `Lattice Strain`：先扩胞到目标尺寸，再做应变扫描"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell` -> `Lattice Strain`: reach the target cell size before scanning"
" strain"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:117
#: 5401550a0d9d4f0d9cfccf577d0688a4
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:119
#: fec2536c8b9a4a3a945b26a60d816a0e
msgid "**输出为空。** 步长 ≤ 0，或者最大值 < 最小值。检查 x/y/z_range。"
msgstr ""
"**No output.** A step is nonpositive or a maximum is below its minimum. "
"Check `x_range`, `y_range`, and `z_range`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:121
#: ec86cf6703d8480caca4cdd851d3a14b
msgid "**结构角度异常变化。** 轴向应变不改变晶格角。如果变了，检查上游结构是否已经带非正交晶格。"
msgstr ""
"**Cell angles changed unexpectedly.** Axial strain does not alter angles; "
"inspect whether the upstream cell was already nonorthogonal."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:123
#: 02e8ca0819244131badd15b00c6584d1
msgid "**组合爆炸。** `triaxial` + 步长 0.5% + ±5% = 21³ = 9261 个结构。先估算 Nx × Ny × Nz 再跑。"
msgstr ""
"**Combinatorial explosion.** `triaxial` with 0.5% steps over ±5% produces "
"21³ = 9,261 structures. Estimate Nx × Ny × Nz before running."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:125
#: ed8249b016b4429b8e09f2be2f7c37e4
msgid "**有机分子键被拉断。** `Identify organic` 没开。"
msgstr "**Intramolecular bonds are stretched or broken.** Enable `Identify organic`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:127
#: 8a2f73c2b0a54d9e9ee9be3c5b24e0a2
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:129
#: 74e2aa32aa3b4a9ab7f1aeec16e4e06a
msgid "`Str(x=-1%,y=2%)` / `Str(all=3%)` 等。"
msgstr "Examples: `Str(x=-1%,y=2%)` and `Str(all=3%)`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:131
#: ecb542bc08144626862bde93ad9cd8a8
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:133
#: 46c6f49a65ff4b99ae4c78988412fd0c
msgid "无随机性。同参数同输入 → 严格一致输出。"
msgstr "Deterministic: identical inputs and parameters produce identical outputs."
